    "title": "Fairmont, West Virginia, city code update allows regulation of open and green spaces | Fairmont News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "FAIRMONT, W.Va. (WV News) — Fairmont City Council passed a pair of ordinances Tuesday that will expand the city code’s definition of parks to include “open spaces and green spaces,” which will allow the city to regulate developing areas like the West Fork River Trail and the downtown greenspace.\nCity Manager Travis Blosser said that some recreation amenities were not well-defined under previous city code language, leading to the change.",
